desc: tk-gui-tools (GUI library, not an effect)
author: John Matthews (Tukan Studios)
version: 1.0.0
changelog: Initial package: tk_gui_tools.jsfx-inc as in https://stash.reaper.fm/v/53055/tk-gui-tools.zip
metapackage: true
provides: tk_gui_tools.jsfx-inc
about:
  # tk-gui-tools
  The JSFX library that draws the GUIs of the effects in this repository
  (A-Lift, P-Clip). Install it once; it is shared by all of them, whatever
  category they are in.

  This package installs only tk_gui_tools.jsfx-inc. The library is written by
  John Matthews (Tukan Studios) and is redistributed here with his permission;
  its terms are at the top of that file. The full archive, with
  examples and documentation, is at
  https://stash.reaper.fm/v/53055/tk-gui-tools.zip

// This file only carries the ReaPack package information for
// tk_gui_tools.jsfx-inc. ReaPack does not install it, and it does nothing as
// an effect.
